1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,790
Start with the question: how do we answer from a document
collection without inventing missing information? Walkthrough of
the offline default path, not a live customer deployment.

2
00:00:15,226 --> 00:00:25,309
The application connects a FastAPI backend with a browser chat
interface. Separate services and interfaces keep each stage
inspectable.

3
00:00:28,744 --> 00:00:39,437
Ingestion splits documents into sentence-aware chunks instead of
arbitrary character slices. Chunk boundaries affect what
evidence retrieval can recover.

4
00:00:42,873 --> 00:00:51,608
The default feature-hashing embedder works without downloading a
model. Reproducible offline development. configurable
embeddings.

5
00:00:55,043 --> 00:01:05,551
A cosine vector store finds candidates. Re-ranking blends
similarity with keyword overlap. Retrieval quality determines
which evidence reaches the reader.

6
00:01:08,987 --> 00:01:20,497
The extractive reader answers from retrieved context and
abstains when the context is insufficient. The default is
extractive, not unrestricted generative completion.

7
00:01:23,932 --> 00:01:32,469
Source citations connect the answer to its originating chunk. A
citation is useful only if the passage supports the claim.

8
00:01:35,905 --> 00:01:46,751
A router sends arithmetic questions to a restricted AST
calculator and other questions to RAG. Tool routing is explicit
and returned to the interface.

9
00:01:50,187 --> 00:01:59,351
Server-Sent Events stream responses through the chat endpoint.
Streaming changes delivery; it does not itself improve factual
quality.

10
00:02:02,787 --> 00:02:13,196
The evaluation harness checks retrieval hit-rate, reciprocal
rank, faithfulness and answer relevance. Sample-corpus
thresholds are gated in CI.

11
00:02:16,632 --> 00:02:30,200
Configuration can swap in sentence-transformers, pgvector,
Ollama, Gemini or OpenAI backends. Optional integrations require
their own runtime setup and evaluation.

12
00:02:33,636 --> 00:02:46,414
The limitation: sample-corpus checks do not establish
reliability across arbitrary documents. Broader corpora,
adversarial missing-evidence cases and abstention tests come
next.

13
00:02:49,850 --> 00:02:56,764
Explore the backend, tests and evaluation code. The best
evidence is the implementation itself.

